{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-applications","title":"风险与 VaR 应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/quantile-regression-methods/practice/risk-applications","wordCount":2094,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"风险与-var-应用\">风险与 VaR 应用</h1><p>金融风险管理几乎就是分位数的同义词。「在 99% 的把握下，这个交易组合明天最多亏多少？」——这句话定义的在险价值（Value at Risk, VaR）本质上就是收益分布的一个低分位数。于是分位数回归在金融里有了最自然、也最高风险的应用：直接对收益的条件分位数建模，而不必假设收益服从正态分布（金融收益恰恰以肥尾著称，正态假设系统性低估风险）。本节讲清 VaR 与分位数的等价、CAViaR 这个自回归分位模型、以及 2025 年监管把重心从 VaR 移向期望损失后分位数方法的位置与硬边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>金融风险管理几乎就是分位数的同义词，本节围绕一组风险量展开。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VaR 即分位数</strong>：置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 下的在险价值是收益分布的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 分位数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VaR}_\\alpha=-Q_\\alpha(R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，于是 VaR 估计直接变成条件分位数回归问题。</li>\n<li><strong>条件化优势</strong>：把波动率、过往收益等作为特征估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_\\alpha(R\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，得到随市场环境伸缩的动态 VaR，且无需正态假设、直接拟合肥尾。</li>\n<li><strong>CAViaR</strong>：对 VaR 写自回归递推（今天的风险与昨天高度相关），用 pinball 损失在半参数框架下估参数，刻画波动聚集而不必指定整条分布。</li>\n<li><strong>突破率回测</strong>：统计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_t&lt;-\\text{VaR}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的频率是否接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，本质是在检验 pinball 的一阶条件「恰 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 比例样本在分位下方」。</li>\n<li><strong>ES 的硬边界</strong>：期望损失是尾部期望而非分位数，且不可单独引出，无法直接用 pinball 回归；出路是 VaR 与 ES 联合建模（二元组联合可引出）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"var-就是一个分位数\">VaR 就是一个分位数</h2><p>设组合在持有期内的收益为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（亏损记为负）。置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（如 99%，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span>）下的 VaR 定义为：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率下损失会超过它。用分位数语言，VaR 正是收益分布的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 分位数（取负号转成正的损失数）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>inf</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VaR}_\\alpha = -\\,Q_\\alpha(R) = -\\inf\\{r: F_R(r)\\ge \\alpha\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">in<span style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">f</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个等价关系把 VaR 估计直接变成一个分位数回归问题。传统业界用三种方法估 VaR：历史模拟（直接取经验分位）、方差-协方差法（假设正态）、蒙特卡洛。分位数回归提供第四条路，且独具优势：它能让 VaR <strong>条件化</strong>于当前市场状态——把波动率、过往收益、宏观指标作为特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_\\alpha(R\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，得到随市场环境伸缩的动态 VaR，而非一个静态数字。这正是 <a href=\"../../foundations/why-quantile-regression\">为何分位数回归</a> 强调的「条件分位随特征移动」在金融里的兑现。下表对照几类 VaR 方法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>VaR 方法</th>\n<th>分布假设</th>\n<th>条件化能力</th>\n<th>肥尾处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方差-协方差</td>\n<td>正态</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>差（低估尾部）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史模拟</td>\n<td>无（用经验分布）</td>\n<td>无（无条件）</td>\n<td>取决于窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒙特卡洛</td>\n<td>需指定模型</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>取决于模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分位数回归 / CAViaR</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>强（直接建条件分位）</td>\n<td>好（直接拟合尾部）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"caviar-自回归的条件分位\">CAViaR：自回归的条件分位</h2><p>Engle 与 Manganelli（2004）提出的条件自回归在险价值（CAViaR）模型，是分位数回归在金融时序里的标志性应用。它的洞察是：VaR 本身有动态——今天的风险水平与昨天高度相关（波动聚集）。于是 CAViaR 直接对 VaR 写一个自回归递推，而不去完整指定收益分布。一个常见形式（对称绝对值型）是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>VaR</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VaR}_t = \\beta_0 + \\beta_1\\,\\text{VaR}_{t-1} + \\beta_2\\,|R_{t-1}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>参数通过最小化 <a href=\"../../foundations/pinball-loss\">Pinball 损失</a>（这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau=\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>）在收益序列上估计——注意目标函数依旧是那个熟悉的 pinball，只是预测项变成了递推式。CAViaR 的好处是半参数：它只刻画分位数的动态，不必假设整条分布，因而对肥尾和波动聚集都稳健，至今仍是风险实务的常用工具。下图给出 CAViaR 的估计与回测流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[收益序列 R_t] --&gt; B[设定 CAViaR 递推&lt;br/&gt;VaR_t = f VaR_t-1, R_t-1; β]&#10;  B --&gt; C[最小化 pinball 损失&lt;br/&gt;τ = α 估 β]&#10;  C --&gt; D[逐日预测 VaR_t]&#10;  D --&gt; E[回测: 统计突破次数&lt;br/&gt;R_t &lt; -VaR_t 的频率]&#10;  E --&gt; F{突破率 ≈ α?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[模型校准良好]&#10;  F --&gt;|否, 突破过多| H[低估风险&lt;br/&gt;重设定/加特征]&#10;  F --&gt;|否, 突破过少| I[过保守&lt;br/&gt;资本占用浪费]\">flowchart TD\n  A[收益序列 R_t] --&gt; B[设定 CAViaR 递推&lt;br/&gt;VaR_t = f VaR_t-1, R_t-1; β]\n  B --&gt; C[最小化 pinball 损失&lt;br/&gt;τ = α 估 β]\n  C --&gt; D[逐日预测 VaR_t]\n  D --&gt; E[回测: 统计突破次数&lt;br/&gt;R_t &lt; -VaR_t 的频率]\n  E --&gt; F{突破率 ≈ α?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[模型校准良好]\n  F --&gt;|否, 突破过多| H[低估风险&lt;br/&gt;重设定/加特征]\n  F --&gt;|否, 突破过少| I[过保守&lt;br/&gt;资本占用浪费]</pre><p>回测是风险模型的生命线：若 99% VaR 被突破的频率显著高于 1%，模型在低估风险，监管和内控都不会接受。突破频率的检验（如 Kupiec 检验）本质是在查 <a href=\"../../foundations/pinball-loss\">Pinball 损失</a> 的一阶条件「恰 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 比例样本在分位下方」是否成立——又一次呼应基础章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2025-监管现实-从-var-到期望损失\">2025 监管现实：从 VaR 到期望损失</h2><p>这里有一个分位数方法绕不开的硬边界，必须讲清。巴塞尔委员会的「交易账簿基本审查」（FRTB）框架已经把市场风险资本计量的主指标从 VaR 换成了<strong>期望损失</strong>（Expected Shortfall, ES），要求银行在 97.5% 置信水平上报告 ES，而非 99% 的 VaR。原因是 VaR 只告诉你「损失会超过某个分位」，却完全不管超过之后有多惨——它对尾部形状视而不见，且不满足次可加性（不是一致风险度量）。ES 则是「超过 VaR 那部分损失的条件期望」，刻画了尾部的厚度。</p>\n<p>对分位数回归，这是个微妙的坏消息：ES 不是一个分位数，而是尾部的期望，因此<strong>不能</strong>像 VaR 那样直接用 pinball 损失回归出来。更深的原因是 ES 不可单独「引出」（not elicitable）——不存在一个损失函数，其期望最小值点恰是 ES，所以分位数回归或递推方法无法直接拓展到 ES。2025 年的研究路线是把 VaR 与 ES <strong>联合</strong>建模：因为「(VaR, ES) 的二元组」是联合可引出的，可以设计联合损失函数同时估两者，CAESar、半参数实现化 ES 等模型即沿此路（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2407.06619\">CAESar, arXiv:2407.06619</a>）。下表把两个指标的可估性摆清。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险度量</th>\n<th>是不是分位数</th>\n<th>能否单独 pinball 回归</th>\n<th>监管地位（FRTB）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VaR<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3014em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是（第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 分位）</td>\n<td>能</td>\n<td>旧主指标，现退居其次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期望损失 ES<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3014em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>否（尾部期望）</td>\n<td>不能（不可单独引出）</td>\n<td>2025 主指标（97.5%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(VaR, ES) 联合</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>能（联合可引出）</td>\n<td>联合建模是研究前沿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"落地注意事项\">落地注意事项</h2><p>把分位数回归用于真实风控，有几条铁律。其一，<strong>尾部分位数据稀少</strong>：估 99% VaR 等于只用约 1% 的极端样本说话，估计方差大，要么用更长历史、要么引入极值理论辅助尾部。其二，<strong>分布偏移致命</strong>：金融市场会突变（危机、政策、流动性枯竭），训练期的条件分位在压力期可能完全失效，模型必须配合压力测试与频繁回测，不能盲信历史。其三，<strong>别把无保证当保证</strong>：分位数回归的 VaR 是点估计，<a href=\"prediction-intervals\">预测区间</a> 里讲的覆盖率问题在此同样存在，监管回测正是在强制检验这个覆盖。最后，风险模型的产出会喂给资本计提与限额决策，错误代价极高——这类高后果应用更应保留人工复核，相关的部署边界在 <a href=\"quantile-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 进一步展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>VaR 本质是收益分布的低分位数，分位数回归可直接估计，且能条件化于市场状态得到动态 VaR，天然处理肥尾、不需正态假设。</li>\n<li>CAViaR 用自回归递推刻画 VaR 的动态（波动聚集），半参数、靠 pinball 损失估计、靠突破率回测校准。</li>\n<li>2025 监管（FRTB）已把主指标从 99% VaR 换为 97.5% 期望损失（ES）；ES 是尾部期望、不是分位数、且不可单独引出，无法直接用 pinball 回归。</li>\n<li>出路是 VaR 与 ES 联合建模（二元组联合可引出），如 CAESar。</li>\n<li>落地铁律：尾部样本稀、分布偏移致命、点估计无覆盖保证、高后果需人工复核。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同库承接：<a href=\"prediction-intervals\">预测区间</a> 的覆盖率检验与此处 VaR 回测同源；<a href=\"quantile-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 收口部署与监控。</li>\n<li>概念前置：<a href=\"../../foundations/pinball-loss\">Pinball 损失</a> 的一阶条件即 VaR 回测的统计基础；<a href=\"../../foundations/conditional-quantiles\">条件分位数</a> 的局部鲁棒性解释为何分位法适合肥尾。</li>\n<li>跨库链接：金融时序的波动建模见 <a href=\"../../time-series-analysis/ts-applications/financial-ts\">时间序列分析 · 金融时序</a>；尾部风险的不确定性量化可对照 <a href=\"../../conformal-prediction-uncertainty/practice/distribution-shift\">共形预测 · 分布偏移</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"风险与 VaR 应用","id":"风险与-var-应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"VaR 就是一个分位数","id":"var-就是一个分位数"},{"level":2,"text":"CAViaR：自回归的条件分位","id":"caviar-自回归的条件分位"},{"level":2,"text":"2025 监管现实：从 VaR 到期望损失","id":"2025-监管现实-从-var-到期望损失"},{"level":2,"text":"落地注意事项","id":"落地注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"预测区间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/quantile-regression-methods/practice/prediction-intervals"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/quantile-regression-methods/practice/quantile-in-practice"}}